- For example, **CVE-2020-0796** (SMBGhost vulnerability) has an EPSS score of 0.9981, indicating a very high likelihood of exploitation within 30 days.
- High EPSS scores suggest prioritizing patching and mitigation for SMB-related vulnerabilities.

